Boundary notes:
  dns-network-ops = ARCHITECTURE + CROSS-PLATFORM + CONCEPTS (resolution, DNSSEC design, security
  layers, platform selection, hybrid design). Platform-specific implementation lives in the eight
  vendor skills. No content duplication: the vendor skills cover named.conf/PowerShell/Corefile/API
  specifics; this umbrella covers the conceptual and comparative layer and routes to them.
  network-source-of-truth owns IPAM and the DNS record-of-intent; dns-network-ops operates the
  resulting zones.

